        "title": "This product is simply amazing!",
        "text": "I recently tried the PetArmor Plus F&T Squeeze-On Dog flea drops for my furry friend, and let me tell you, it's been a game-changer! Not only is it completely waterproof, but it also lasts up to 30 days, providing long-lasting protection against those pesky fleas. And with 6 applications in each package, it's a great value for the price. The best part? My dog doesn't mind it at all! The application process is quick and easy, and he doesn't experience any discomfort. I couldn't be happier with this product. The only thing I wish is that it came with even more applications in each package because it's that good! If you're looking for a reliable and effective flea treatment for your furry companion, look no further than PetArmor Plus F&T Squeeze-On Dog flea drops. Your dog will thank you, and you'll have peace of mind knowing they're protected. Highly recommend!",
