        "title": "I've been very happy with PetArmor Plus F&T Squ...",
        "text": "As a pet owner, finding a flea and tick treatment that actually works can be a challenge. But I've been very happy with PetArmor Plus for my extra large dog. Not only is it waterproof, but it also breaks the flea cycle, kills fleas and ticks, and even kills flea eggs and larvae. With a vet-quality formula, I can trust that my furry friend is getting the best protection possible. And the fact that it comes in a pack of 6 means I don't have to constantly restock. The only thing that could be improved is the price. It would be great if it were more affordable, but the effectiveness of the product definitely outweighs the cost. Overall, I highly recommend PetArmor Plus for any dog owner looking for a reliable flea and tick treatment that lasts up to 30 days.",
